@startuml

scale max 1024 width
scale max 800 height

skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

skinparam database {
  BorderColor Grey
}

component "PostgreSQL Channel\nSubscription Processor" as subProc #lightblue
component "Event Subscription\nBatch Processor" as batchProc #lightblue
component "Async Event Handler\n(OrderIntegrationEventSender)" as handler #lightblue
queue "Apache Kafka\nMessage Broker" as kafka #White

database "PostgreSQL Database" {
  component eventTbl [
  **ES_EVENT** Table
  |= ""ID"" |= ""TRANSACTION_ID"" |= ""EVENT_TYPE"" |
  | 101 | 855 | OrderPlacedEvent |
  ]

  component subTbl [
  **ES_EVENT_SUBSCRIPTION** Table
  |= ""SUBSCRIPTION_NAME"" |= ""LAST_TRANSACTION_ID"" |= ""LAST_EVENT_ID"" |
  | ""OrderIntegrationSender"" | 855 | 101 |
  ]

  component dlqTbl [
  **ES_EVENT_SUBSCRIPTION_DEAD_LETTER** Table
  |= ""ID"" |= ""EVENT_ID"" |= ""EXCEPTION_CLASS"" |= ""ERROR_MESSAGE"" |
  | 1 | 101 | ""JsonProcessingException"" | ""Corrupted payload"" |
  ]
}

subProc --> eventTbl: **1.** Read new committed events
subProc -> batchProc: **2.** Dispatch event batch
batchProc -> handler: **3.** Invoke handler\n(Exponential backoff retry 1s, 2s, 4s)
handler -right-> kafka: **4a.** Publish message\l(Success)
handler -.-> batchProc: **4b.** Persistent failure\l(Poison pill)
batchProc --> dlqTbl: **5.** Isolate failing event\lto DLQ
batchProc --> subTbl: **6.** Advance checkpoint\l(Stream continues unblocked!)

@enduml
